    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The might of the moon fills you, improving your Moon's Inspiration.</p><p><strong>Shadow of the New Moon.</strong> When you use Inspired Eclipse, the creature that received the Bardic Inspiration die can also have the Invisible condition and immediately take a Reaction to teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. It stays Invisible until the start of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Vibrance of the Full Moon.</strong> When you use Lunar Vitality, you can roll 1d6 and use the number rolled instead of expending a Bardic Inspiration die.</p>",
